			"notes": "Added Optional Discord Integration via MelonUtilities. With MelonUtilities, BTAFK will send a discord message when a player has become afk, is no longer afk, and has joined for the first time.\n\nAdded the ability to configure BTAFK in btafk.cfg.\nConfiguration includes:\nEnabling/Disabling all AFK behavior\nTicks until considered AFK,\nAFK message,\nNo longer AFK message,\nEnabling/Disabling sending discord messages for AFK changes,\nEnabling/Disabling all First Join Message behavior\nWelcome message, and\nEnabling/Disabling sending discord messages for First Joins\n\nCustom messages can use %s to specify the player being refrenced, and can use minecraft's color formatting code for colors in messages.\n\n<img width=\"2541\" height=\"988\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b1c784c1-8837-4030-b9b9-5aae6e496dd8\" />\n\n<img width=\"1671\" height=\"435\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8db6e8cd-462c-44da-a13e-ce99cd9ff0f3\" />"
		},
